                <p data-cms-key="moatDataBody" data-sanity-title="Moat: data body" data-sanity-path="fields[_key==&quot;moatDataBody&quot;].value" data-sanity-type="lockedText" data-sanity-id="notco-marketing-home" data-sanity-document-type="lockedMarketingPage" data-sanity="id=notco-marketing-home;type=lockedMarketingPage;path=fields:moatDataBody.value;base=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.sanity.io%2F%40oVfUQFQ7U%2Fstudio%2Fwshr3mwhrtws1p2d1heghqzv%2Fnotco" data-remarkable-path="fields[_key==&quot;moatDataBody&quot;]" data-remarkable-type="lockedText">A decade of high-fidelity, normalized, provenance-rich data generated through instrumented protocols and real production programs. <br> <br>Not scraped. Not synthetic. Not on the internet.</p>
