              <article class="moat is-active" data-moat-card="1">
                <h3 data-cms-key="moatWorkflowTitle" data-sanity-title="Moat: workflow title" data-sanity-path="fields[_key==&quot;moatWorkflowTitle&quot;].value" data-sanity-type="lockedHeading" data-sanity-id="notco-marketing-home" data-sanity-document-type="lockedMarketingPage" data-sanity="id=notco-marketing-home;type=lockedMarketingPage;path=fields:moatWorkflowTitle.value;base=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.sanity.io%2F%40oVfUQFQ7U%2Fstudio%2Fwshr3mwhrtws1p2d1heghqzv%2Fnotco" data-remarkable-path="fields[_key==&quot;moatWorkflowTitle&quot;]" data-remarkable-type="lockedHeading">Deep workflow integration</h3>
                <p data-cms-key="moatWorkflowBody" data-sanity-title="Moat: workflow body" data-sanity-path="fields[_key==&quot;moatWorkflowBody&quot;].value" data-sanity-type="lockedText" data-sanity-id="notco-marketing-home" data-sanity-document-type="lockedMarketingPage" data-sanity="id=notco-marketing-home;type=lockedMarketingPage;path=fields:moatWorkflowBody.value;base=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.sanity.io%2F%40oVfUQFQ7U%2Fstudio%2Fwshr3mwhrtws1p2d1heghqzv%2Fnotco" data-remarkable-path="fields[_key==&quot;moatWorkflowBody&quot;]" data-remarkable-type="lockedText">An OS embedded in your processes and integrated with your systems working as a single unified workflow for R&amp;D, Procurement, Marketing, and Operations. Built from the inside by doing product development, not observing it from the outside.</p>
